### Featured Project

- **[Txoko · Pamplona Gastronomic RAG Assistant](https://github.com/DieguinhoMonge/pamplona-gastronomic-bot)**  
  End-to-end Retrieval-Augmented Generation chatbot over 20 local restaurant PDFs in Pamplona & Navarra. Built with **LangChain**, **ChromaDB**, local multilingual embeddings (`paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2`), **BM25 + RRF hybrid retrieval**, incremental summary-buffer memory, **Gemini**, and **Streamlit**, featuring EU AI Act (Limited Risk) compliance and a 26-case automated evaluation suite.

